 "text": "Their quirks, their faces so clear."}, {"beat": 228, "text": "In this soothing ambiance,"}, {"beat": 236, "text": "I feel at home, it\u2019s like a trance!"}, {"beat": 244, "text": "[outro]"}, {"beat": 252, "text": ""}]}}}